00:01:54.918 --> 00:01:59.698
New York mayor Zoran Mamdani on Friday put out a plan to shut the Rikers Island jail complex,

00:02:00.118 --> 00:02:05.558
the Guardian reports, and to move whoever is still held there into smaller jails in four burrows by the end of

00:02:05.558 --> 00:02:11.838
2032. He said it is time to finally close Rikers Island and that the plan would cut pre-trial detention,

00:02:11.838 --> 00:02:17.458
action, attack trial delays, and put $146 million into supports he called evidence-based.

00:02:18.098 --> 00:02:22.418
NPR says the city is moving after years of talk and that the jail has been marked by

00:02:22.418 --> 00:02:23.878
